vyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"MC5pczUOBUN-0MtJAYk46Q","review_id":"SH1kqui02tHUO997DlpbBg","date":"2017-12-17T04:04:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9373468160629272,"text_excerpt":"I ventured into Melissa and Michele's store , CupCake Fairies. I bought 4 large cup cakes in a cup. They were layered with three different toppings. I have never eaten sweets, y'all, but my loved one was channeling me to get something, so I went into CupCake Fairies. Keep channeling honey, this is great. I am sold and hooked on this store and it's cup cake genius creations. In cup cake heaven. I met one of the two proprietress, and I felt, it was very welcoming. That was a winner for me. There are all different type cakes, and they are able to make or cater just about anything you want. I think they just don't know they have created a cup cake monster. Store is big enough for you to enjoy..."},{"business_id":"MC5pczUOBUN-0MtJAYk46Q","review_id":"pLUXJ9ljqY5hLNJr5JP7gQ","date":"2014-06-06T23:21:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9268888235092163,"text_excerpt":"Fair warning: I enjoy cupcakes. I was in Riverwalk at the kiosk. That said..... Innovation!!! Never before have I been served a cupcake in an actual cup. It had a lid. I could eat a bit now and drop it in my purse for later. No walking around looking silly shoving cake my mouth.... I could eat it like a civilized person.... With a spoon! They have spoons! I have no idea what the cake tastes like. I have the sniffles, all i can taste right now are extremes. The texture was nice, no dryness. And the frosting is fairly light. Gonna have to go back after I get the taste buds in order."},{"business_id":"MC5pczUOBUN-0MtJAYk46Q","review_id":"NJ2RCnYHed7wCs98sQssrQ","date":"2018-07-29T04:10:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9232540130615234,"text_excerpt":"I was gifted (thanks sis) with a brownie from Cupcake Fairies. It was huge,fudgey deliciousness! If pecans or walnuts will be added to the mix they may become a weekly staple for me. Lol."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
